(2k) Purification: Hexane:EtOAc (9:1). Colorless solid 47.8 mg (0.099
mmol, 99%). 1H‐NMR (400 MHz, CD2Cl2) δ = 7.62‐7.60 (m, 2H), 7.49‐7.47
(m,1H), 7.32‐7.29 (m, 2H), 7.21‐7.18 (m, 1H), 7.13‐7.10 (m, 1H),7.08‐7.06
