MHz, CD2Cl2) δ = 161.7 (d, J = 242.7 Hz), 142.8 (d, J = 3.1 Hz), 138.6,
138.1,137.1, 135.4, 128.8 (d, J = 7.6 Hz), 128.6, 127.6, 121.3, 119.4,
118.1, 115.3 (d, J = 21.1 Hz),110.1, 109.3, 92.7, 46.2, 40.5, 30.8, 29.7,
22.5 ppm. MS (EI) m/z (%): 481 (100), 359 (95), 344 (5), 232 (17), 217
(39). HRMS (ESI+) m/z calculated for C25H21NFINa (M+Na+) 504.059492,
found 504.059141. Mp: 132‐133 °C (CH2Cl2) The enantiomeric ratio was
