vial at 30 °C until complete conversion was indicated by TLC. The crude
reaction mixture was directly submitted to column chromatography on SiO2.
The racemates were prepared by heating a 1:1 mixture of the corresponding
hydrazone and diphenyl phosphate to 80 °C in toluene for 1 h. The crude
reaction mixture was directly submitted to column chromatography on SiO2.
(S)‐9‐Benzyl‐3‐phenyl‐2,3,4,9‐tetrahydro‐1H‐carbazole (2a) Purification:
Hexane:EtOAc (9:1).
(S)‐9‐(4‐Iodobenzyl)‐3‐(naphthalen‐2‐yl)‐2,3,4,9‐tetrahydro‐1H‐carbazole
(2o) Purification: Hexane:EtOAc (9:1). Colorless solid 51.0 mg (0.099
mmol, 99%). 1H‐NMR (400 MHz, CD2Cl2) δ = 7.89‐7.81 (m, 3H), 7.78‐7.77(m,
1H), 7.62‐7.59 (m, 2H), 7.53‐7.50 (m, 2H), 7.49‐7.44 (m,2H), 7.22‐7.19
(m, 1H), 7.15‐7.07 (m, 2H), 6.79‐6.76 (m, 2H),5.25 (d, J = 17.1 Hz, 1H),
5.20 (d, J = 17.1 Hz, 1H), 3.30‐3.18(m, 2H), 3.02‐2.95 (m, 1H), 2.86‐2.79
(m, 2H), 2.36‐2.29 (m, 1H), 2.27‐2.17 (m, 1H) ppm. 13C‐NMR (100 MHz,
CD2Cl2) δ = 138.1, 137.1, 135.6, 134.1, 132.7, 128.6, 128.2, 127.9,
127.9,127.8, 126.5, 126.3, 125.6, 125.3, 121.3, 119.4, 118.2, 110.3,
109.3, 92.7, 46.2, 41.4, 30.7,29.5, 22.6 ppm. MS (EI) m/z (%): 513 (100),
359 (94), 232 (12), 217 (31), 154 (9). HRMS (ESI+) m/z calculated for
C29H24NINa (M+Na+) 536.085466, found 536.084749. The enantiomeric ratio
was determined by reversed phase HPLC analysis using Daicel Chiralcel
OD‐RH column: MeCN:H2O = 90:10, flow rate 1.0 mL/min, λ = 220 nm: τ1 =
9.39 min, τ2 = 10.50 min.
