$DATUM stereoselective, mol. sieves used, alternative reaction conditions gave
lower yield and selectivity, Amberlite CG50 in H+ form used, 94:6 er,
alternative reaction conditions shown, sealed vial used, optimization
study, optimized on catalyst and additives, Fischer indolization
