Hz), 7.5 (1H, s), 4.47 (q, 2H, J=10.7), 1.4 (2H, t, J=7.12). 13C NMR: δ
14, 61, 87, 108, 115, 122, 131, 132, 140, 145, 161. MS (EI eV 70): m/z
(%): (M+) 235. Anal. calcd. (%): C, 56.41; H, 4.30; N, 11.96. Found (%)
C, 55.81; H, 4.12; N, 11.01.
